<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-SPAIN LEAD DENMARK IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPAIN LEAD DENMARK IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TARRAGONA, Spain 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain took a 1-0 lead over Denmark in their Davis Cup tennis World Group qualifying round tie after winning the opening singles on Friday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Alberto Costa (Spain) beat Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark) 6-0 6-0 6-2</p>
